{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/4727155ba97e43788f3f5325b5093df9.poster.avif?t=1763317994\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/4727155ba97e43788f3f5325b5093df9.webm?t=1763317994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/4727155ba97e43788f3f5325b5093df9.mp4?t=1763317994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Someone's junk is another one's treasure. And with these treasure's the robots on your home world have developed into a fast-paced cyberpunk/ sci-fi society. To keep it growing and take them to the next level, interstellar commerce is needed. That's where you come in with your startup transportation company. Transport/ trade, build and combat your way to become the legendary Tycoon Tai-pan.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/535bb1b5f3c704ddbe8dc299974e73c9.poster.avif?t=1763317994\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/535bb1b5f3c704ddbe8dc299974e73c9.webm?t=1763317994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/535bb1b5f3c704ddbe8dc299974e73c9.mp4?t=1763317994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>What will they want, need and think of next? There's plenty to do at home, it's time to take control and decide the future. You get to build/ own the businesses, infrastructure and much more. Takeover factories, ship at half the cost and make twice the profit! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/5a0cb82109e9f05f32492c2b3993dc98.poster.avif?t=1763317994\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/5a0cb82109e9f05f32492c2b3993dc98.webm?t=1763317994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/5a0cb82109e9f05f32492c2b3993dc98.mp4?t=1763317994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Get the job done by designing &amp; building spaceships to deliver your cargo across the galaxy! Bring back the luxury liners, explore the cosmos in style and maybe even find the lost planet of E-den.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/4999d421fa68d8a04c3178929035d0f3.poster.avif?t=1763317994\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/4999d421fa68d8a04c3178929035d0f3.webm?t=1763317994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/4999d421fa68d8a04c3178929035d0f3.mp4?t=1763317994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As your galactic empire and fame grow, so do the risks! Competitors/ space pirates would love to get their hands on the lucrative cargo and will attack your shipping lanes. Well they'll be in for a surprise or two? You and your captains command cruisers, ready to defend and win any battle! At least it's what you read in the brochure that came with the ship. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/46d5f5f62a9ff431a0f7d66571e26e52.poster.avif?t=1763317994\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/46d5f5f62a9ff431a0f7d66571e26e52.webm?t=1763317994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/46d5f5f62a9ff431a0f7d66571e26e52.mp4?t=1763317994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Develop a successful transport/ trading company.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Galactic stock exchange, with over 65 items being traded.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Logarithmic algorithms to mimic a real world economy.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Design &amp; build spaceships.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Collect junk &amp; turn it into treasure, bring back what once was like the luxury liners or upgrade it to something better.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Take care of the needs/ wants of your home world, decide their future and achieve the legendary Tycoon Tai-pan repute.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tinker around &amp; discover new technology.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Uncover the stories &amp; secrets of the life-forms you meet.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Own businesses like restaurants, factories or night clubs.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use diplomacy or combat.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore a huge galaxy with over 500 solar systems.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Procedurally generated, never play the same game.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Develop transport routes across the galaxy.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Hire captains to run your fleet.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1614880?t=1763317994","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763317994","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i