y to defend and win any battle! At least it's what you read in the brochure that came with the ship. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/46d5f5f62a9ff431a0f7d66571e26e52.poster.avif?t=1763317994\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/46d5f5f62a9ff431a0f7d66571e26e52.webm?t=1763317994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614880/extras/46d5f5f62a9ff431a0f7d66571e26e52.mp4?t=1763317994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Develop a successful transport/ trading company.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Galactic stock exchange, with over 65 items being traded.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Logarithmic algorithms to mimic a real world economy.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Design &amp; build spaceships.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Collect junk &amp; turn it into treasure, bring back what once was like the luxury liners or upgrade it to something better.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Take care of the needs/ wants of your home world, decide their future and achieve the legendary Tycoon Tai-pan repute.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Tinker around &amp; discover new technology.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Uncover the stories &amp; secrets of the life-forms you meet.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Own businesses like restaurants, factories or night clubs.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Use diplomacy or combat.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore a huge galaxy with over 500 solar systems.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Procedurally generated, never play the same game.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Develop transport routes across the galaxy.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><l